templateVersions.content:
Summarize the following Salesforce Account record in a professional paragraph format for internal review:

Account Name: {{Name}}
Salutation: {{Salutation}} {{FirstName}} {{LastName}}
Title: {{PersonTitle}}, Department: {{PersonDepartment}}
Account Number: {{AccountNumber}}, Site: {{Site}}, Record Type: {{RecordTypeId}}
Owner ID: {{OwnerId}}, Created By: {{CreatedById}}, Last Modified By: {{LastModifiedById}}

Contact Details:
Phone: {{Phone}}, Mobile: {{PersonMobilePhone}}, Email: {{PersonEmail}}

Financial Overview:
Monthly Income: {{Monthly_Income__c}}, Monthly Expenses: {{Monthly_Expenses__c}}, Monthly Savings: {{Monthly_Savings__c}}, Other Expenses: {{Other_Expenses__c}}, Education: {{Education__c}}, Entertainment: {{Entertainment__c}}, Food: {{Food__c}}, Health: {{Health__c}}

Preferences & Status:
Lead Source: {{PersonLeadSource}}, Customer Interest: {{Customer_Interest__c}}, Risk Appetite: {{Risk_Appetite__c}}, Active: {{IsActive}}, Buyer Account: {{IsBuyer}}, Partner Account: {{IsPartner}}

Birthdate: {{PersonBirthdate}}, Gender Identity: {{PersonGenderIdentity}}, Pronouns: {{PersonPronouns}}

Please use this summary to assess and follow up as necessary.

Based on the following Salesforce Account record, generate a structured summary in JSON format with the following keys:
['compliance report', 'insights from store audits and product surveys', 'other useful insights']

Use this data:
Account Name: {!$Input:Account.Name}
Salutation: {!$Input:Account.Salutation}
First Name: {!$Input:Account.FirstName}
Last Name: {!$Input:Account.LastName}
Account Number: {!$Input:Account.AccountNumber}
Customer Interest: {!$Input:Account.Customer_Interest__c}
Description: {!$Input:Account.Description}
Education: {!$Input:Account.Education__c}
Effective Date: {!$Input:Account.EffectiveDate}
Email: {!$Input:Account.PersonEmail}
Entertainment: {!$Input:Account.Entertainment__c}
Food: {!$Input:Account.Food__c}
Gender Identity: {!$Input:Account.PersonGenderIdentity}
Health: {!$Input:Account.Health__c}
Home Phone: {!$Input:Account.PersonHomePhone}
Mobile: {!$Input:Account.PersonMobilePhone}
Monthly Expenses: {!$Input:Account.Monthly_Expenses__c}
Monthly Income: {!$Input:Account.Monthly_Income__c}
Monthly Savings: {!$Input:Account.Monthly_Savings__c}
Other Expenses: {!$Input:Account.Other_Expenses__c}
Phone: {!$Input:Account.Phone}
Risk Appetite: {!$Input:Account.Risk_Appetite__c}

Instructions:
- Generate a short compliance report.
- Analyze financial patterns from Monthly Income, Expenses, and Savings.
- Identify any risks from Risk Appetite, Rating, and related fields.
- Recommend actions based on interests, portal status, and program tier.
- Suggest cross-selling or upselling opportunities.
- Include other customer insights based on behavior and profile.

